# UI Design System

Before changing HTML, CSS, or frontend JS, read `design-system/AGENTS.md`.

- Dashboards (`admin`, `app`, `backoffice`) share `src/main/resources/admin/style.css`. Extend that file; do not add a second stylesheet.
- Use existing classes and tokens (`design-system/components.md`, `design-system/tokens.md`).
- User-facing copy goes through `admin/catalog.{en,pt,es}.js` (`design-system/i18n.md`).
- Widget uses `tbl-` classes in `widget.css` only. Legal pages stay standalone.

Do not hardcode colors, new fonts, or locale strings in render functions.
